      "message": "Head unit is linked to a car. METADATA_MANUFACTURER_NAME and METADATA_MODEL_NAME will hold the values for the car, METADATA_HEAD_UNIT_MANUFACTURER_NAME and METADATA_HEAD_UNIT_MODEL_NAME will hold the values for the head unit (infotainment system) that is inside the car.\nFor example, a Kia Forte car can have Pioneer DMH-W3000NEX as the head unit.",
